  [PASS] E5d G_loc diverges relative to |grad Phi| at the binary's centre, where grad K -> 0   (at (0, 1e-6, 0): |grad Phi| = 2.000e-06, G_loc = 1.000e+06, ratio = 5.000e+11)

  Miyamoto-Nagai disc (a = 4, b = 0.3), in the midplane z = 0.01:
    R =   2.0   |grad Phi| = 0.018798   G_loc = 0.364938   ratio = 19.4135
    R =   4.0   |grad Phi| = 0.019759   G_loc = 0.177815   ratio = 8.9990
