  The physical kill.  Local curvature in a galaxy is dominated by the NEAREST STAR, not by the
  Galaxy.  MOND's y is the coherent, coarse-grained field.  These are different quantities.
    smooth Galaxy tidal field at R_sun            |d^2Phi| = 8.191e-31 s^-2
